                                                "sense_id": "0602808e-2e4a-39b6-a61d-e6f791059999",
                                                "text": "As Ukrainian forces struggled to hold the flattened city, it was claimed that civilians in captured territory were being deceived into leaving shelters to be bussed out to Russian camps by soldiers wielding loudhailers."
